/**
 * Vendor column map - the single source of truth for the vendor export, the
 * downloadable template and the Excel importer.
 *
 * Headers keep the spellings the previous importer accepted ("Company Name",
 * "Pan_No", "Ref1_First_Name", ...), including the "Contact Mddele Name" typo,
 * which is carried here as an alias so existing sheets keep working.
 */

